How many times is the statement `count++` executed when the fragment below runs with $n = 16$?

```c
int count = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i = i * 2)
    for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++)
        count++;
```

What is the time complexity of the following fragment as a function of $n$?

```c
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++)
