Consider the function below. How many times in total is `print` called when `f(16)` is executed? (Integer division.)

```c
void f(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return;
    f(n / 2);
    f(n / 2);
    f(n / 2);
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
        print(i);
}
```

