The function below computes $x^n$ for $n$ a power of 2. How many multiplications does `power(x, n)` perform, as a function of $n$?

```c
double power(double x, int n) {
    if (n == 1) return x;
    return power(x, n / 2) * power(x, n / 2);
}
```
